# Digest fixtures: git must not touch a single byte.
#
# `-text` disables ALL end-of-line conversion for these paths. Without it,
# `core.autocrlf=true` on a Windows clone rewrites crlf.txt and cr.txt on
# checkout, the fixtures stop describing what they claim to describe, and the
# suite proves the opposite of what it was written for.
#
# `-diff` marks them binary for diffing: a diff of trailing whitespace is
# unreadable anyway, and marking them binary stops a reviewer's tooling from
# offering to "clean" them.
* -text -diff

# Keep the tooling and metadata in this directory normal.
digests.json text eol=lf
README.md text eol=lf
tools/generate.py text eol=lf
